+Liveliness
+==========
+
+A liveliness token can be used to provide the network with information about connectivity to its
+declarer. When constructed, a PUT sample will be received by liveliness subscribers on intersecting key
+expressions. A DELETE on the token's key expression will be received by subscribers if the token is
+destroyed, or if connectivity between the subscriber and the token's creator is lost.
+
+Liveliness tokens are declared via ``Session::liveliness_declare_token``. Liveliness subscribers
+and queries are also available on the ``Session`` class (``liveliness_declare_subscriber``, ``liveliness_get``).
+
+.. doxygenclass:: zenoh::LivelinessToken
+   :members:
+   :membergroups: Constructors Operators Methods
